# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# Raw research materials must NEVER be committed.
#
# The wiki source vault (~/Documents/PhD_research) is a separate, unpublished
# repository. This site only ever reads its `wiki/*.md` prose and renders it to
# HTML; `raw/` — the paper PDFs, scanned notes and cloned repos — is never read
# and never copied here. The patterns below are a second line of defence in case
# anything is dragged into this tree by hand.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
raw/
**/raw/
*.pdf
*.epub
*.djvu
*.docx
*.pptx

# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
# The rendered wiki is restricted. It is built into _private/ and deployed to
# Cloudflare Pages behind a GitHub sign-in (deploy-wiki.sh) — never to GitHub,
# because anything in this repository is world-readable.
# ---------------------------------------------------------------------------
_private/
/wiki/
search.json
pages.json
.wrangler/

# Build tooling
.venv/
__pycache__/
*.pyc

# Any stray copy of the source vault
PhD_research/
vault/
*.base
.obsidian/

# OS
.DS_Store
Thumbs.db
